otential performance increases still available in this file, but this is a simple enough fix for the immediate problem. \r\n\r\nThe following query:\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst maliciousQuery = `{ ${'hello '.repeat(2000)}}`;\r\n```\r\n\r\nnow takes 564ms on my machine, and on main takes 12s. ","created_at":"2023-08-24T11:36:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T15:45:00Z","closed_at":"2023-09-05T18:29:41Z","merged_at":"2023-09-05T18:29:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"f94b511386c7e47bd0380dcd56553dc063320226","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":1197187805,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTk3MTg3ODA1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/labels/PR:%20bug%20fix%20%F0%9F%90%9E","name":"PR: bug fix 🐞","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"requires increase of \"patch\" version number","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/pulls/3958/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/pulls/3958/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/3958/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/statuses/2991112867dbe25937c330806864e133951a57e7","head":{"label":"AaronMoat:fix-performance-degradation","ref":"fix-performance-degradation","sha":"2991112867dbe25937c330806864e133951a57e7","user":{"login":"AaronMoat","id":2937187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzcxODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2937187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat","html_url":"https://github.com/AaronMoat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api